@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
title 05. Supervisor Agent LangGraph4J Orchestration

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam ActivityDiamondFontSize 12

start

:Request validated;
:Load history/checkpoint;
:Build SupervisorGraphState;
:Invoke CompiledGraph;

#FFE7A8:PLAN_INTENT node;
note right
<size:10>CallLLM</size>
end note
:RISK_ASSESS node;
:HITL_GATE node;
:WAIT_REVIEW node (if required);
:APPLY_REVIEW node (APPROVE/CANCEL);
:SELECT_DOWNSTREAM node;

if (review decision = CANCEL?) then (yes)
  :mark canceled + stop compose;
  stop
elseif (routing plan exists?) then (yes)
  :CALL_A2A node;
  :HANDOFF_EVALUATE node;
  if (handoff.enabled = false?) then (yes)
    :HANDOFF_SKIPPED_BY_FLAG;
  elseif (valid handoff directive?) then (yes)
    :HANDOFF_APPLY node;
  else (no)
    :HANDOFF_SKIPPED_BY_POLICY;
  endif
  :Emit progress via SupervisorProgressSupport;
  if (more plans?) then (yes)
    :loop next routing plan;
  endif
else (no)
endif

:MERGE_RESULTS node;
#FFE7A8:COMPOSE_RESPONSE node;
note right
<size:10>CallLLM</size>
end note
:Persist history/checkpoint;

stop

note right
Graph contract
- nodes: plan, risk_assess, hitl_gate, wait_review, apply_review, select, invoke, merge, compose
- handoff branch: invoke -> handoff_evaluate -> (handoff_apply|handoff_skipped) -> merge
- edge: select -> (invoke|compose)
- invoke loop has max iteration guard
- downstream call boundary is A2A only
- data mutation(create/update/delete) requests always pass WAIT_REVIEW
- graph state snapshot + swarm shared state must be persisted together
- handoff feature flag default is off (`handoff.enabled=false`)
- handoff method must be in allowed enum
- stream handoff requires downstream streaming support
end note

' 2026-04-13 sync with doc 34
' - add handoff evaluate/apply/skipped branch
' - add feature-flag behavior and progress common module usage
' 2026-04-12 sync with docs 30/31
' - Scope: HITL decision limited to APPROVE/CANCEL in current phase
' - Data mutation requests (create/update/delete) require mandatory HITL
' - A2A compatibility mode keeps both legacy and v1.0 methods
' - User profile input collection is deferred to next phase
@enduml
